WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.520
Death. It’s an excellent topic of conversation&nbsp;
because it’s so relatable - After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.800
it’s bound to happen to all of us. Well,&nbsp;
except Dr. Bright. Sorry, Jack. The leading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.480
causes of death for most normal people are heart&nbsp;
disease, cancer, accidents, and strokes, but for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:21.760
people working at the SCP Foundation - or those&nbsp;
unlucky enough to have brushes with the anomalous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:28.000
in civilian life - the wheel of misfortune has&nbsp;
plenty more options for your inevitable demise.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.400
We’re not talking about boring deaths like&nbsp;
being eaten by a giant killer reptile or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.840
being disintegrated on an atomic level by a giant,&nbsp;
winged guardian with a sword hotter than the sun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:43.040
The truly sticky ends we’re talking about&nbsp;
today will make weak-sauce fatalities like that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.720
look like passing away peacefully&nbsp;
in your sleep. Prepare for a big,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:54.400
warm spoonful of existential terror, because this&nbsp;
is the worst ways to die - SCP Foundation edition!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:01.680
Let’s kick off this carnival of death with an&nbsp;
old friend of ours: Uncle Larry himself, SCP-106,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:07.200
also known as The Old Man. This SCP&nbsp;
celebrity is infamous for two things:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:11.840
His ability to walk through solid objects,&nbsp;
and his absolute adoration for causing pain.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:15.760
Seriously, this is a guy who loves&nbsp;
torturing people so much that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:20.640
has his own pocket dimension specifically&nbsp;
tailored for the grisly task. That’s why,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:26.000
if you fall into his greasy black claws, you’ve&nbsp;
got an utterly nightmarish death in store for you.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.480
Expect to be tortured and mutilated&nbsp;
over an extremely long period of time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:34.800
His greatest hits include pulling out your teeth,&nbsp;
shoving his fingers or even arms into your body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:39.680
and of course, melting you. Thankfully, a lot&nbsp;
of the finer details of what this freak does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:44.080
to his victims are either redacted or not&nbsp;
recorded - probably for the sake of all of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:49.840
our collective sanities. But for some context,&nbsp;
one of his recovered victims looked like this.&nbsp;

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:54.640
The worst part? He was still alive&nbsp;
when that photo was taken. Sleep tight!

00:01:54.640 --> 00:02:00.000
Or, alternatively, don’t. Because&nbsp;
if you have SCP-966 on your tail,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.880
you won’t be sleeping at all. These nasty&nbsp;
little gremlins are called the Sleep Killers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.520
which is somewhat ironic because, as part of&nbsp;
their protracted stalking and hunting period,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.880
they disable their victim’s ability to sleep.&nbsp;
Picture that: Invisible monsters keeping you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:20.560
awake forever, leading to a period of deadly&nbsp;
insomnia. You’ll become tired, but you’ll never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:26.240
know rest. You’ll start hallucinating. You’ll get&nbsp;
weak. Everyone around you will just think you’re&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:30.880
very sick, and they’ll probably recommend&nbsp;
everything from Nyquil to Valerian root.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:37.520
But none of it will help. Nothing will help.&nbsp;
Technically, you’re a walking corpse already. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:42.560
just when you think it can’t get any worse, when&nbsp;
your mind has practically been turned to soup in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:47.920
your head by the sleep deprivation...That’s when&nbsp;
the Sleep Killers will finally strike. They’ll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:54.160
attack, tear you to pieces, and eat you alive.&nbsp;
You will have gone through your own personal hell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:57.680
and nobody will ever know what happened to you.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:02.320
Say, speaking of personal hells and long,&nbsp;
traumatic deaths, let’s mosey on over to our next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:09.600
horrific method of spin-kicking off the mortal&nbsp;
coil: SCP-439, also known as the Bone Hive. If&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.840
you’re familiar with this nasty customer already,&nbsp;
then I’m sorry you’re about to go through this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:19.840
nightmare again, but for the rest of you, this&nbsp;
SCP is a species of tiny, silver earwigs with some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:25.920
truly unique breeding and nesting habits. Namely,&nbsp;
they make their nests out of living people.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:29.040
The queen of their colonies will crawl&nbsp;
into your body while you’re sleeping,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:34.160
leading to what seems at first like a nasty&nbsp;
cough and some bodily aches and pains. These&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:39.440
soon become so agonizing that you’re paralyzed.&nbsp;
You lock yourself into a small, dark place,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:44.720
at which point the rapidly breeding earwigs inside&nbsp;
you will start to convert your body into a huge,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:50.720
calcium hive. They’ll turn your internal organs&nbsp;
into breeding centers and food sources. You’ll be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:57.840
alive through all of this, too. Why? Because your&nbsp;
living body acts as an internal heating system.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:02.800
You will die in the end, if that’s&nbsp;
any consolation...of starvation.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:08.000
Wow. What a bummer, right? I think we could&nbsp;
all use a good laugh after that last one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:13.520
Thankfully, we’ve got SCP-2030, also known as&nbsp;
Laugh is Fun, to deliver some levity into this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:18.800
otherwise dire situation. 2030 is probably&nbsp;
the ultimate hardcore hidden camera show,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:23.760
where the terrifying anomalous pranks often lead&nbsp;
to their victims meeting gruesome ends. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:28.880
their victims and surrounding bystanders often&nbsp;
find these nightmarish deaths weirdly funny,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.480
the ends that 2030 dishes out&nbsp;
are enough to turn your stomach.

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:37.760
Here are a few examples for you, just to whet&nbsp;
- or permanently destroy - your appetite:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:41.840
An old woman feeding pigeons in the park&nbsp;
had a hundred pigeons fly down her throat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:47.440
bursting her stomach open. A man was flayed alive&nbsp;
and had his skin filled with live squirrels.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:51.600
A woman was attacked by a lump of flesh shaped&nbsp;
like an amalgamation of Margaret Thatchers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:56.080
which then shoved its tongue down her throat,&nbsp;
causing her body to be transformed into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.080 --> 00:05:00.560
collection of Margaret Thatcher faces too.&nbsp;
And the scariest thing is that all of these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:06.720
victims technically died by more normal means&nbsp;
already. That’s right: Everyone who stars in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:11.760
this twisted show is already dead before they&nbsp;
ever make their appearance. Their restless&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:18.040
souls drawn into the nightmare of SCP-2030,&nbsp;
where they’re killed again in even worse ways.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:22.720
Phew, baby, that was unpleasant.&nbsp;
Let’s instead talk about The Baby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:29.360
No, not Da Baby, we’re talking&nbsp;
about SCP-734, The Baby. Let’s go!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:34.720
This cute little baby seems innocent enough,&nbsp;
and in terms of his personality, he is. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:39.440
the bodily fluids of this baby can give you&nbsp;
a truly sickening death. If you come into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.760
contact with the baby’s fluids, you’ll begin to&nbsp;
experience what first seems like an aggressive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:49.440
skin condition - pain, itching, and redness. This&nbsp;
will then lead to even more unpleasant and painful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:55.200
skin flaking, which will soon begin to expand&nbsp;
over your body, eating away at you more and more.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.200 --> 00:06:00.480
The flaking will get wider and deeper. Your&nbsp;
organs and bones will start to disintegrate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:04.720
Little by little, you’ll painfully&nbsp;
fall to pieces over a number of hours.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:08.560
By the time you’re dead, you’ll look&nbsp;
like a big pile of bloody dandruff.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.440
Needless to say, it’s incredibly unpleasant.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:15.920
Speaking of big, unpleasant piles, let’s talk&nbsp;
about the horrifying death you can get courtesy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:22.960
of SCP-162, also known by the appropriately&nbsp;
ominous name: The Ball of Sharp. This thing is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:29.120
so deadly that it’s one of the many SCPs that the&nbsp;
Foundation has tried to use to terminate SCP-682.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:33.600
It’s an eight-foot-tall pile of fish hooks,&nbsp;
fish line, needles, scissors, and almost every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:38.160
other sharp, pointy object you can imagine.&nbsp;
You’ve heard of a needle in a haystack? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:43.440
meet the needle stack, where the hay is&nbsp;
you! And scariest of all, this SCP has the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:48.480
cognitohazardous effect of brainwashing you&nbsp;
into wanting to jump into its spiky embrace.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:53.120
And if you jump into the Ball of Sharp...Well,&nbsp;
what the heck do you think happens? You’ll get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:57.920
poked and stabbed and cut horrifically. And&nbsp;
because of the cognitohazardous effects, you’ll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:02.160
alternate between complaining about horrific&nbsp;
pain, to talking about how much you love it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:05.440
and would like to be left alone&nbsp;
with the Ball. And of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:10.080
in the end, you’ll either bleed to death&nbsp;
or die of extreme body trauma. Yay!

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:15.040
Y’know, if you really think about it, the Ball of&nbsp;
Sharp seems a little like an avant-garde modern&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:20.080
art piece. Perhaps it’s a commentary on how&nbsp;
much it’d suck to get thrown into a giant ball&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:27.040
of pointy objects. Speaking of art and things that&nbsp;
suck, it’d really suck to be murdered by SCP-1155,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:31.760
the Predatory Street Art. This horrific,&nbsp;
two-dimensional predator is a piece of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:37.680
evil graffiti that preys on solitary victims&nbsp;
who happen to stray too close to its grasp.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:42.800
And the Predatory Street Art is a monster so&nbsp;
gratuitously violent, it’d probably get along&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:47.520
really well with Uncle Larry. It won’t just&nbsp;
kill and eat you like a standard predator,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:52.480
it’ll kill you, chop you up, and put your body&nbsp;
parts in its gory cupboard in order to eat you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:57.200
as a midnight snack later. And while this&nbsp;
is a gruesome way to go, it’s still nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:02.240
compared to the sheer, mind-bending horror that&nbsp;
getting killed by the next anomaly will bring.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:08.880
Christmas only comes once a year, and&nbsp;
SCP-4666, also known as The Yule Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:14.160
will make you extremely grateful for that. This&nbsp;
living nightmare of an anomaly only operates over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:19.360
a twelve-day period during the Christmas season,&nbsp;
and if you happen to be on this sadistic Santa’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:24.080
naughty list, you’re probably in for a horrible&nbsp;
fate that is literally beyond what we’re able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:29.120
fully describe here. To give you some perspective:&nbsp;
If you’re lucky, he’ll just murder you and your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:33.760
entire family in one evening - normally&nbsp;
using torture, mutilation, and cannibalism.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:39.920
And if you’re unlucky and also underage, then&nbsp;
the Yule Man will take you down to his workshop,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:45.120
where you’ll act as his slave, and spend&nbsp;
the rest of your life making morbid toys.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:48.960
And then, if you’re the luckiest among&nbsp;
the unlucky, he’ll take you aside and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:54.000
eat you when he’s feeling hungry. If not,&nbsp;
he’ll work you until your body breaks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.400
then force your fellow workers to convert&nbsp;
you into a toy while you’re still alive.

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:04.240
That’s right: If you’re not fit enough to keep&nbsp;
slaving away and make the toys, you’ll literally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:10.560
be made into the toys. Needless to say, you&nbsp;
certainly won’t be having a Merry Christmas.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:15.680
Okay, that was a little intense. Maybe we should&nbsp;
take a seat and relax for a second...Wait,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:22.000
where’s my chair? This is just a pile&nbsp;
of wood chips! Oh, I see, it’s SCP-1609,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:26.240
the remains of a chair. What’s this doing in the&nbsp;
video? We’re making a video on gruesome deaths,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:28.400
we don’t need a goofy pile of&nbsp;
wood chips throwing everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.880
out of-
Okay, okay, I’m sorry!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:40.640
I won’t talk down to you again! I should have&nbsp;
remembered: When SCP-1609 feels threatened,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:44.800
it teleports wood chips and metal&nbsp;
fragments into the lungs of its victim,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:48.800
tearing them apart from within and leading&nbsp;
to their victims choking to death on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:53.600
own blood...Come to think of it, this probably&nbsp;
does deserve to be on a list of the worst deaths.

00:09:53.600 --> 00:10:00.080
And finally, we’ve got SCP-149, also known&nbsp;
as the Blood Flies. To the untrained eye,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:05.200
these nasty little suckers are just mosquitos.&nbsp;
Non-anomalous mosquitos might give you malaria&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:09.520
if you’re unlucky, but outside of that, the worst&nbsp;
thing you’ll probably get from these guys is an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:15.840
itchy bite mark. That’s definitely not the case&nbsp;
for SCP-149. If one of these creatures bites you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.840
you’re infected with a retrovirus that&nbsp;
mutates regenerating human cells into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:25.200
fertilized mosquito eggs. We’re off to a&nbsp;
rough start already, but it gets worse.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:30.080
Within a five-hour period, the victim is covered&nbsp;
in large, hard cysts filled with live mosquito&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.960
larvae. By this point, they’ve reached full&nbsp;
maturation, and begin to exit the body en&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:41.520
masse - through the nose, mouth, and eye sockets.&nbsp;
Infection by SCP-149 is fatal, and the chance of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:47.440
infection has been estimated to be 50% from one&nbsp;
bite. It almost has you wishing for malaria.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:51.280
And there you have it, folks, some of&nbsp;
the most horrific ways you can die at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:55.680
hands of some of the monsters, objects,&nbsp;
and concepts from the SCP Foundation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:59.840
But if we’re being totally honest with you,&nbsp;
that’s barely even scratching the surface.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:05.680
There are so many awful ways to die in the SCP&nbsp;
Universe, it’d be almost impossible to cover them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:11.360
in one video. If you want to see more horrifying&nbsp;
SCP deaths, let us know down in the comments.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:14.560
If, of course, you live that long...

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:17.920
Now go check out “Evil Monster&nbsp;
Created by SCP Foundation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:22.400
SCP-2419 - The Laughing Men”&nbsp;
and “Irresistible Pick-up Artist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:28.640
SCP-3512 - The More You Know” for more SCP&nbsp;
Foundation scenarios that’ll give you nightmares!

